  "solution": {
    "text": "The given line is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are the lengths of the perpendiculars from the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;respectively on the given line,&nbsp;then<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br />Clearly,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> are in GP",
